304、304L、316L、321、2205、2507.

TA2、904L、C276etc.]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<h3>Structural Principles</h3>
<p>Edith Wedge Wire Screens are composed of wedge-shaped (V-profile) surface wires and support rods resistance-welded together, They serve as metallic mesh-like filter elements designed for screening and filtration purposes, characterized by high mechanical strength, clog-resistant surfaces, large open area, allowing for backwashing, incurring no operational costs, requiring no maintenance, and minimizing downtime.</p>
<hr />
<h3>Product Features</h3>
<ul>
<li>Clog-resistant, the V-shaped wires form wedge-shapedslots ensuring unobstructed flow.</li>
<li>Large open area with a variety of V-wire diameters available for selection, ensuring high water flow efficiency.</li>
<li>Low pressure loss, high mechanical performance, and wear resistance.</li>
<li>High precision slot openings, with automatic welding en-suring uniform slot size accuracy.</li>
</ul>
]]></content:encoded>
					
