		<pubDate>Thu, 21 Nov 2024 03:53:23 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid isPermaLink="false">http://filter.philitee.com/?post_type=product&#038;p=2615</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<h3>Materials</h3>
304、304L、316L、321、2205、2507、TA2、904L、C276etc.]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<h3>Structural Principles</h3>
<p>Conical screen baskets are typically made from nick-el-chromium woven mesh or laser perforation, whereas the conical screen baskets manufactured by Idess using wedge wire mesh offer a superior alternative. The V-shaped wire centrifuge screen baskets provide precise, customized slot sizes to meet customer needs and enhance starch refining processes.</p>
<hr />
<h3>Product Features</h3>
<ul>
<li>Compared to nickel-chromium mesh, it enhances fiber dewatering.</li>
<li>It has a longer service life and is more convenient for cleaning.</li>
<li>The minimum slot opening can reach 20 microns.</li>
<li>Superior V-shaped wires are selected for anti-clogging properties, capable of withstanding high backwashing pressures.</li>
</ul>
<hr />
<h3>Application Area</h3>
<p>They are generally widely used in applications such as potato fiber separation, potato refining, cassava starch processing, and in horizontal decanter centrifuges.</p>
