304、304L、316L、321、2205、2507、TA2、904L、C276etc.]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<h3>Structural Principles</h3>
<p>The arc screen is an economical and practical solid-liquid separation device, particularly widely used in the pulp and paper industry as well as in livestock farming. Its V-shaped screen surface with a water-cut design enhances the filtration area and effectiveness during operation.</p>
<hr />
<h3>Product Features</h3>
<ul>
<li>The stainless steel V-shaped wire grid type arc screen plate features slot widths ranging from 20 to 3500 micrometers.</li>
<li>Automatic cleaning of sieve plates and feeding ports,convenient, economical and practical.</li>
<li>With a compact structure, it is convenient for installation operation, and maintenance, devoid of rotating components, ensuring reliable operation.</li>
<li>Featuring a continuous slot design, it boasts a large open area with excellent filtration performance. Selection can be tailored according to the specific requirements of the application process.</li>
</ul>
]]></content:encoded>
					
